   "title": ".Notes",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "TT SDXL text-to-image for Photoshop (SD-PPP 2.0).\n\nPanel shows: 01 Prompt, 02 Negative prompt, 03 Sampler, 05 LoRA. Nodes titled with a leading '.' are hidden from the panel; '#' forces a node to show. Results land in the Save Image preview; use 'Send to PS' to place them as a layer.\n\nLimits of the TT backend: text-to-image only. Keep denoise at 1.0 (img2img raises an error), 1024x1024 only, no masks / inpainting, so do not wire a Load Image from Photoshop into this graph.\n\nLoRA: un-bypass node 05 (Ctrl+B in ComfyUI) and pick an sdxl/ adapter.\n\nNo TT_UnloadModel here on purpose: free the boards with the separate tt_shutdown_reset workflow when you are done."
   ]
  }
